                                PracticeQuestion(prompt: "Disagree with a plan, politely, with data.", expected: ["I see it slightly differently — the data shows a drop.", "I see your point; however, the numbers say otherwise."], focus: "soft disagreement", watch: "Data first, tone soft: no “you're wrong”.")]),
                exercises: [
